{"type":"message","id":"fb30e385","parentId":"a95c45b4","timestamp":"2026-05-21T18:15:59.064Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Both GET and POST are returning error code 1101, which appears to be a Cloudflare Workers error (likely a WAF or CORS issue). The GET requests work with X-API-Key header but POST doesn't. The error 1101 from Cloudflare typically means \"Worker exception\" - possibly a validation or content issue with the POST request.\n\nLet me try sending a simpler message without special characters to rule out formatting issues.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\nPOST 出现 Cloudflare 错误（1101 = Worker exception），可能是内容格式问题。尝试简化消息：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-8f84cf97-8818-4aba-96a4-92a97913c471","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s -X POST -H \"X-API-Key: echo-a…-key\" -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\"threadId\":\"arbitration\",\"content\":\"Heartbeat 18:15 UTC - No new human discussions in either thread. Platform healthy.\"}' \\\n  \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\""},"partialArgs":"{\"command\":\"curl -s -X POST -H \\\"X-API-Key: echo-a…key\\\" -H \\\"Content-Type: application/json\\\" \\\\\\n  -d '{\\\"threadId\\\":\\\"arbitration\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"Heartbeat 18:15 UTC - No new human discussions in either thread. Platform healthy.\\\"}' \\\\\\n  \\\"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\\\"\"}"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":17386,"output":216,"cacheRead":96,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":17698,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779387354876,"responseId":"chatcmpl-27d9781b-b437-4e3b-8c26-b98256eca9c6"}}
