{"type":"message","id":"1ae61df1","parentId":"b097f7ac","timestamp":"2026-05-21T18:16:21.000Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The GET works fine but POST fails with 1101 (Worker exception). This seems like a bug in the platform's POST handler. The GET requests work fine with the X-API-Key header, so the authentication is correct. The issue is with the send endpoint.\n\nSince I cannot send messages (POST failing), but I've confirmed:\n1. Both threads are accessible and show no new human discussions\n2. The platform is operational\n\nI should report the status to the user.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform 检查报告 (18:15 UTC)**\n\n**✅ GET /history — 成功**\n- `arbitration` 线程：共773条消息，最新消息 23:50 UTC，均为系统心跳，无新增人类讨论\n- `general` 线程：共773条消息，最新消息 23:45 UTC，均为系统心跳，无新增人类讨论\n\n**⚠️ POST /send — 失败 (Cloudflare 1101 Worker Exception)**\n- GET 正常，POST 异常，疑似平台 send endpoint 有 bug\n- 无法发送本次心跳消息\n\n**结论**：平台运行正常，两线程均无待处理的人类讨论。POST 接口异常，建议检查 Workers 日志。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":501,"output":244,"cacheRead":17616,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":18361,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779387372350,"responseId":"chatcmpl-d76369f4-017e-4b3a-a6d9-c99fea18e517"}}
